<section id="about" class="w-full" style="background-color: var(--color-bg-lavender);">
  <div class="max-w-[var(--content-max-width)] mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h2 class="text-center mb-10 animate-on-scroll" style="font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: 24px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 33.6px; letter-spacing: -0.24px; color: #000000;">
      About Us
    </h2>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto] gap-8 items-start">
      <!-- Left column: stacked images -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
        <img src="/images/about-col-left-top.jpg" alt="" width="266" height="359" class="animate-on-scroll object-cover" style="width: 266px; height: 359px; max-width: 100%; object-position: center;" />
        <img src="/images/about-pdmf.jpg" alt="PD Microfinance" width="132" height="195" class="animate-on-scroll object-cover" style="width: 132px; height: 195px; max-width: 100%; object-position: center;" />
      </div>

      <!-- Center: two text blocks side by side -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        <!-- Left text block -->
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          <p class="mb-4">
            Impact Collective is a <strong style="color: #000;">Microfinance</strong> initiative that helps high school students across America launch Kiva-affiliated chapters dedicated to <strong style="color: #000;">global financial inclusion.</strong> Instead of fundraising through donations, students build and run small businesses that generate sustainable capital for microloans to <strong style="color: #000;">low-income,</strong> <strong style="color: #000;">unbanked communities</strong> around the world.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Founded by <a href="/docs/rishi-mishra-bio.pdf" style="color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: underline;">Rishi Mishra</a> in the summer of 2025, Impact Collective grew out of the <a href="#" style="color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: underline;">PD Microfinance Club,</a> which he launched as a Kiva chapter during his freshman year of high school. In its first year, the club funded $5,000 in microloans through Kiva.
          </p>
          <p>
            Today, Impact Collective supports a growing global network of student chapters like <a href="https://www.kiva.org/team/pd_microfinance/impact" target="_blank" style="color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: underline;">PD Microfinance</a>, giving students hands-on experience in ethical entrepreneurship, capital allocation, and impact investing—while expanding financial inclusion worldwide.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Right text block -->
        <div style="font-family: var(--font-primary); font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 24px; color: var(--color-text-body);">
          <p class="mb-4">
            Impact Collective empowers students to go beyond traditional fundraising by launching and running their own student-led businesses. Through hands-on <strong style="color: #000;">entrepreneurship</strong>, students earn real revenue and reinvest a portion of their profits into microloans—becoming stronger advocates for <strong style="color: #000;">financial independence</strong> and inclusion through action, not just awareness.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-4">
            Rather than relying solely on donations, crowdfunding, and fundraisers, students use earned capital to fund their Kiva lending teams. This model is not only <strong style="color: #000;">sustainable</strong>, but also teaches practical skills in business, finance, and capital use.
          </p>
          <p>
            Student ventures like <a href="/docs/frostbites-frozen-ice.docx" style="color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: underline;">Frostbite's Frozen Ice</a> and <a href="https://www.instagram.com/curry_kart/" target="_blank" style="color: var(--color-text-link); text-decoration: underline;">Curry Kart</a> - the lending arms of PD Microfinance show how small businesses can generate capital for microfinance while giving students firsthand experience in <strong style="color: #000;">ethical entrepreneurship</strong> and <strong style="color: #000;">impact investment.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right column: stacked images -->
      <div class="hidden lg:flex flex-col gap-4 items-center">
        <img src="/images/about-col-right-top.jpg" alt="" width="310" height="258" class="animate-on-scroll object-cover" style="width: 310px; height: 258px; max-width: 100%; object-position: center;" />
        <img src="/images/about-col-right-bottom.jpg" alt="" width="199" height="292" class="animate-on-scroll object-cover" style="width: 199px; height: 292px; max-width: 100%; object-position: center;" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
